    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Travel Joy is a modern and responsive Full Site Editing (FSE) travel WordPress theme designed for travel agencies, tour operators, trekking companies, and tourism-related businesses. The theme features a clean and professional layout that helps showcase travel destinations, tour packages, itineraries, and booking information effectively. It is fully compatible with WP Travel, allowing users to easily manage trips and bookings directly from the WordPress dashboard. WENS Travel Joy also includes flexible customization options through the WordPress Customizer, enabling users to personalize colors, layouts, typography, banners, and homepage sections without coding knowledge. With its mobile-friendly design and blog functionality, the theme is an excellent choice for creating professional travel booking and tourism websites."
    },
